    "title": "Which former Kokomo Standard area high school standouts will be in action on Sunday, March 2?",
    "text": "Ra Shaya Kyle and McKenna Layden\nRa Shaya Kyle and McKenna Layden\nBen Humrichous\nIllinois Fighting Illini\nForward\nGraduate\n6′9″ 220\nTipton High School\nNext Game: vs. Michigan Wolverines, Sunday, March 2, 2:45 p.m.\nMcKenna Layden\nPurdue Boilermakers\nGuard\nSophomore\n6′2″\nNorthwestern Senior High School\nHometown: Kokomo\nNext Game: vs. Indiana Hoosiers, Sunday, March 2, 2 p.m.\nRa Shaya Kyle\nFlorida Gators\nCenter\nSenior\n6′6″\nMarion High School\nNext Game: vs. Texas Longhorns, Sunday, March 2, 2 p.m.",
